526
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:10,200
Right. We might just be cheering from special seats.

527
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:12,000
Or maybe we'll be cheering from up on stage.

528
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:14,000
Oh, that'd be nice!

529
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:15,800
Yeah, that'd be nice!

530
00:26:15,800 --> 00:26:18,800
