582
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:24,300
The front has the Nene mascot, and the back has the RISE logo.

583
00:28:24,300 --> 00:28:26,460
The neon orange pops against the white T-shirt and towel —

584
00:28:26,460 --> 00:28:27,300
