614
00:29:46,180 --> 00:29:48,120
A neon light fits in it too.

615
00:29:48,120 --> 00:29:49,860
A penlight fits in it too!

616
00:29:49,860 --> 00:29:54,340
You'll feel like you're out bug-catching!

617
00:29:54,340 --> 00:29:57,780
Also, on the baseball T-shirt,

618
00:29:57,780 --> 00:30:00,340
