626
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:15,120
Oh, it might be a badge.

627
00:30:15,120 --> 00:30:19,000
Hold on, Nene — ah, we're checking on that, sorry!

628
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:19,900
My apologies!

629
00:30:19,900 --> 00:30:21,520
Checking now.

630
00:30:21,520 --> 00:30:24,660
So, the baseball shirt,

631
00:30:24,660 --> 00:30:27,700
the Neon Towel,

632
00:30:27,700 --> 00:30:29,620
