659
00:31:49,980 --> 00:31:53,890
But since it's a Nekko uniform, it felt right to go with Nekko.

660
00:31:53,890 --> 00:31:55,980
Ah, yes, yes, that's right!

661
00:31:55,980 --> 00:31:57,180
Yeah, that's how it went.

662
00:31:57,180 --> 00:32:01,480
We went with Nekko because we imagined it as a Nekko uniform.

663
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:05,180
Right, right — in the end, it's Nekko who wears it on their back!

