00:32:41,360 --> 00:32:46,100
Uniforms have been trending a bit for live goods lately, so...

680
00:32:46,100 --> 00:32:47,360
Oh really?

681
00:32:47,360 --> 00:32:49,920
Yes, definitely, please get one!

682
00:32:49,920 --> 00:32:54,320
