701
00:33:37,340 --> 00:33:39,060
Wow!

702
00:33:39,060 --> 00:33:44,740
The key visual and the background just work so well together!

703
00:33:44,740 --> 00:33:48,460
So I wanted to make both of them into goods!

704
00:33:48,460 --> 00:33:53,080
And then they suggested this pop-out design for us!

705
00:33:53,080 --> 00:33:54,220
That's great!

706
00:33:54,220 --> 00:34:00,340
I hope everyone picks one up and keeps it as a memento!

707
00:34:00,340 --> 00:34:03,600
Hopefully it'll bring back memories when you look at it!

708
00:34:03,600 --> 00:34:08,860
And that's all the actual photos of the live goods!

709
00:34:08,860 --> 00:34:11,300
