713
00:34:24,200 --> 00:34:28,080
Please make sure you don't forget, everyone!

714
00:34:28,080 --> 00:34:30,260
Don't forget!

715
00:34:30,260 --> 00:34:32,980
Please, please~!

716
00:34:32,980 --> 00:34:34,620
Please, please, please, please~!

